# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets out of it.
# Anything listed here is never sent to the Docker daemon.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
out
**/out
dist
build

# Secrets — must never enter an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

.git
.github
.gitignore

# Local noise
*.log
**/*.log
.DS_Store
coverage
**/coverage
.vscode
.idea
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Docs / infra that don't affect the build
*.md
!README.md
supabase/
